id: terrain-slam
name: Terrain Slam
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 7
requirement: 1+ ranks of the Powerbomb Advantage
requires: has:powerbomb
summary: After the attack, a Might Clash against each target: win, slam them into an adjacent Square or Feature.
description: >
  Your attack slams an enemy into the scenery, causing massive damage.
text: >
  Terrain Slam: Your attack slams an enemy into the scenery, causing massive damage.
  –TP Cost: 7
  –Requirement: 1+ ranks of the Powerbomb Advantage
  –Effect: After concluding this Attacking Maneuver, make a Might Clash against the target(s) of this Attacking Maneuver. If you win this Clash against an Opponent, choose an unoccupied Square or a Feature adjacent to that Opponent. That Opponent collides with your chosen Square/Feature.

